---
import { page, asset } from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Roller Banners" active="roller-banners">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Roller Banners</span>

        <h1>Bold <span>Displays</span> That Get Noticed</h1>

        <p>
          Professional roller banners for events, exhibitions and promotions.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href={page('contact/')} class="hero-btn">
            Get a Quote
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <img
          src={asset('assets/images/2.roller-banners/hero.png')}
          alt="Advertising and promotional banner display"
        />
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-content">
   
    <section>
      <h2>Roller Banners</h2>
    
      <p>
        Roller banners offer an effective and professional way
        to showcase your brand, products, or promotional
        messages with minimal effort. Providing
        <strong>instant branding and maximum convenience</strong>,
        these portable display systems are ideal for exhibitions,
        conferences, retail environments, presentations,
        and point-of-sale promotions.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Designed for quick and effortless setup, roller banners
        can be assembled in just moments. Simply remove the
        stand from its carry bag, extend the graphic from the
        base, and secure it using the supporting pole.
        When your event is finished, the graphic retracts
        neatly into the base unit, helping to protect it
        during transportation and storage.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Our roller banner range includes a variety of sizes,
        styles, and finishes to suit different requirements
        and budgets. From economical displays for occasional
        promotions to premium systems designed for regular
        professional use, there are options to accommodate
        a wide range of presentation needs.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Selected models also feature interchangeable graphics
        or removable cassette systems, allowing promotional
        messages to be updated without replacing the entire
        stand. Double-sided options are available for
        environments where visibility from multiple
        directions is important.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Lightweight, compact, and easy to transport, roller
        banners provide a practical solution for businesses
        that need reliable promotional displays across
        multiple venues. Whether used individually or
        alongside other exhibition equipment, they help
        create a consistent and professional brand presence.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Key Features &amp; Benefits</h3>
    
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Quick and simple roll-up display system</li>
        <li>Available widths of 800, 850, 1000, 1200, and 1500mm</li>
        <li>Custom height options available</li>
        <li>Economy, standard, and premium finishes</li>
        <li>Retractable graphics for convenient storage and protection</li>
        <li>Interchangeable graphics on selected models</li>
        <li>Removable cassette systems for easy graphic replacement</li>
        <li>Double-sided display options available</li>
        <li>Lightweight construction for easy transportation</li>
        <li>Compact design with convenient carry bag storage</li>
        <li>Suitable for exhibitions, retail promotions, and events</li>
        <li>Ideal for repeated use across multiple locations</li>
      </ul>
    </section>


    <section class="row text-center image-content">
      <div class="col-12">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/2.roller-banners/image1.jpg')} alt="Portable modular exhibition stand setup at a conference" />
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
